== Notes ==
* This floor cannot be skipped with {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} or {{p|Ehwaz}}; neither will work.
** The floor can be skipped if a {{R|Black Market}} or {{R|I AM ERROR}} room is found, {{dlc|r}} or a trapdoor is created with {{i|D12|n}}. This will always take the player to {{s|Sheol}}.
*** {{dlc|r}} {{r|I AM ERROR}} room can contain a beam of light that takes Isaac to {{s|Cathedral}}.
** {{I|Genesis}} will skip the floor, and always take the player to {{s|Cathedral}}.
* ??? has its own {{R|Devil Room}}/{{R|Angel Room}} which can be reached via a {{e|Red Chest}} or a {{p|Joker}}.
* ??? doesn't have {{R|Secret Room}}s, a {{R|Super Secret Room}}, or an {{R|Ultra Secret Room}}.
* {{dlc+|a+}} Using {{I|Mama Mega!}}, {{I|Mega Bean|r+}} or holding {{T|Strange Key}} will open the entrance even if the time limit has expired.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r}} When {{i|Suplex!}} is used while a {{i|Berserk!}} effect is ending, Isaac lands with an explosion similar to {{i|Mama Mega!}}. This explosion can open the entrance after the time limit has expired.{{dlc-}}
* Rocks contained in ??? have a significantly increased chance of spawning a {{R|Crawl Space}} when destroyed.
* {{i|Red Key}} creates exclusive room layouts that contain the following enemies:
{{entity table | Blue Boil, Hush Fly, Blue Gaper, Blue Conjoined Fatty }}
* {{dlc+|r}} Despite red rooms being able to be created, no {{r|Ultra Secret Room}}s appear, even when using {{p|XVIII - The Moon?}}.{{dlc-}}

